  "Q00178_IconicTrinity/32255-10.html": {
   "file": "Q00178_IconicTrinity/32255-10.html",
   "quest": 178,
   "text": "Icon of the Past: ######################## ??? : You must have been sent by Kekropus. Since you have found me, it will not be long before you leave this island. As you have come this far into Nornil's Cave, your physical development must be impressive... Then, as requested by Kekropus, I will tell …",
