  "Q00178_IconicTrinity/32255-12.html": {
   "file": "Q00178_IconicTrinity/32255-12.html",
   "quest": 178,
   "text": "Icon of the Past: ######################## N: You know, of course, that the Kamael do not serve the gods as do the other races, who generally serve the god or goddess who created them. In this way, the Elves serve Eva, the Dark Elves serve Shilen, the Dwarves serve Maphr, the Orcs serve Pa'agrio, a…",
   "header": "Icon of the Past",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "\"Someone other than a god, perhaps...?\"",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00178_IconicTrinity 32255-13.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00178_IconicTrinity",
     "event": "32255-13.html",
     "quest": 178,
     "to": "Q00178_IconicTrinity/32255-13.html",
     "effect": "cond:2"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00178_IconicTrinity/32255-13.html": {
   "file": "Q00178_IconicTrinity/32255-13.html",
   "quest": 178,
   "text": "Icon of the Past: ######################## %name1%: Are you saying that someone other than a god created us? N : Well...what do you think? Curb your impatience. Relax and think. Based on what you will hear and feel in the future, the day will come when you will make your own decision... I will cont…",
   "header": "Icon of the Past",
   "sets": {
    "cond": "2"
   },
   "outcome": "cond",
   "links": []
  },
